ObservationalSUCC.SpectralPurity.exceptional_normalized_bound : ∀ (H eta : ℝ) (q : ℕ → ℝ) (bad : ℕ → Prop)
  [inst : DecidablePred bad] (N : ℕ),
  0 < H →
    0 < N →
      0 ≤ eta →
        (∀ m ∈ Finset.range N, q m ≤ H ^ 2) →
          (∀ m ∈ Finset.range N, ¬bad m → q m ≤ H * (1 + eta)) →
            ObservationalSUCC.SpectralPurity.rawEnergy H q N / (↑N ^ 2 * H) - 1 ≤
              (H - 1) / ↑N + eta * (↑N - 1) / ↑N + 2 * H * ObservationalSUCC.SpectralPurity.badWeight bad N / ↑N ^ 2
'ObservationalSUCC.SpectralPurity.exceptional_normalized_bound' depends on axioms: [propext,
 Classical.choice,
 Quot.sound]
